      "value": "Hi, @{622e83bceb079229d53abe8f|full_name}! Thank you for your request.\n\nUnfortunately, we're unable to add GoGo Loco as a native part of VRChat because it's a third-party asset with its own license.\n\nHowever, here are some things we *could* do:\n\n- Add GoGo Loco to the VRChat Creation Companion as a curated package.\n\n- Add specific features from GoGo Loco to all VRChat avatars.\n\nIf one of those sounds appealing, please submit a Canny request! It helps if you're as specific as possible. It's difficult for us to complete Canny requests that a very broad or not specific enough.",
